Hi Sam,

I probably won't be able to switch the positions around, but I can see if m=
y new incoming hosts are open to changing sites as they will only be here f=
or 1 month.  I will give them a call tomorrow about it and see if they are =
open to swapping sites.

[cid:image001.jpg@01DB7619.FCA0ACD0]Logan Bliss | Volunteer Services Lead/R=
anger 1
